<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>หมู่ฟังก์ชันและสารชีวโมเลกุล - เคมีพื้นฐานของสิ่งมีชีวิต ม.4</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts (Kanit & Prompt) -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kanit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Prompt:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Three.js Library for 3D Render -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
    <!-- OrbitControls for Three.js -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.128.0/examples/js/controls/OrbitControls.js"></script>
    <!-- Canvas Confetti -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Prompt', 'Kanit', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f2fe 0%, #fef3c7 50%, #fbcfe8 100%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: #1e293b;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        .font-kanit {
            font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
        }
        
        /* Floating background bubble animations */
        .bio-bubble {
            position: fixed;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
            backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8), 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
            animation: floatUp 16s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes floatUp {
            0% { transform: translateY(105vh) rotate(0deg) scale(0.8); opacity: 0; }
            20% { opacity: 0.8; }
            80% { opacity: 0.8; }
            100% { transform: translateY(-15vh) rotate(360deg) scale(1.2); opacity: 0; }
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #f1f5f9;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #38bdf8;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        
        .pop-bounce {
            animation: popBounce 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) forwards;
        }
        @keyframes popBounce {
            0% { transform: scale(0.3); opacity: 0; }
            70% { transform: scale(1.08); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }

        .tube-glass {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.85) 0%, rgba(224,242,254,0.4) 100%);
            border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.9), 0 10px 25px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15);
        }

        .cute-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -5px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.08), 0 4px 12px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        }

        .btn-bounce {
            transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
        }
        .btn-bounce:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
        }
        .btn-bounce:active {
            transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.97);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between relative">

    <!-- Floating Background Decorative Bubbles -->
    <div class="bio-bubble w-16 h-16 left-[5%]" style="animation-delay: 0s; animation-duration: 14s;"></div>
    <div class="bio-bubble w-24 h-24 left-[20%]" style="animation-delay: 3s; animation-duration: 18s;"></div>
    <div class="bio-bubble w-12 h-12 left-[45%]" style="animation-delay: 1s; animation-duration: 12s;"></div>
    <div class="bio-bubble w-20 h-20 left-[70%]" style="animation-delay: 5s; animation-duration: 15s;"></div>
    <div class="bio-bubble w-16 h-16 left-[88%]" style="animation-delay: 2s; animation-duration: 17s;"></div>

    <!-- Header Navigation Bar -->
    <header class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-40 border-b-4 border-sky-300 shadow-md">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="bg-gradient-to-tr from-sky-400 to-emerald-400 text-white p-3 rounded-2xl shadow-md text-2xl font-black flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 transform -rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-atom animate-spin-slow"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-wide font-kanit text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-600 via-indigo-600 to-pink-500">
                        เคมีพื้นฐานของสิ่งมีชีวิต
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold flex items-center gap-1">
                        <span class="bg-amber-300 text-amber-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold">ม.4</span>
                        เรื่อง หมู่ฟังก์ชันและสารชีวโมเลกุล ✨
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Navigation Tabs -->
            <nav class="flex space-x-1 md:space-x-2 bg-sky-100/80 p-1.5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-sky-200">
                <button onclick="switchTab('funcGroup3DTab')" id="btn-funcGroup3DTab" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 bg-white text-sky-700 shadow-md font-bold text-xs md:text-sm btn-bounce flex items-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cube mr-2 text-sky-500 text-base"></i> 1. สำรวจโมเดล 3D & เกม 3D
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('nutrientLabTab')" id="btn-nutrientLabTab" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-slate-600 hover:text-sky-700 font-bold text-xs md:text-sm btn-bounce flex items-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-flask-vial mr-2 text-amber-500 text-base"></i> 2. ทดสอบสารอาหาร
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab('quizTab')" id="btn-quizTab" class="tab-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-slate-600 hover:text-indigo-700 font-bold text-xs md:text-sm btn-bounce flex items-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star mr-2 text-indigo-500 text-base"></i> 3. แบบทดสอบ
                </button>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 flex-grow w-full z-10 relative">

        <!-- SECTION 1: 3D FUNCTIONAL GROUP VISUALIZER & 3D GAME -->
        <section id="funcGroup3DTab" class="tab-content space-y-6">
            <div class="cute-card border-l-8 border-sky-400 p-4 rounded-3xl shadow-sm flex items-start space-x-3 text-slate-700">
                <div class="bg-sky-100 text-sky-600 p-2.5 rounded-2xl text-xl flex-shrink-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    <span class="font-bold text-sky-900 text-sm block">💡 วัตถุประสงค์การเรียนรู้:</span> 
                    ศึกษาสูตรโครงสร้าง 3D ของหมู่ฟังก์ชันทั้ง 7 ชนิด ใช้เมาส์ลากหมุนโมเดล 3D ได้รอบทิศทาง (360°) และท้าทายความจำด้วย **3D Guessing Game**
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Mode Switch: Explorer vs 3D Game -->
            <div class="flex justify-center my-2">
                <div class="bg-white/80 p-1.5 rounded-2xl flex space-x-2 border-2 border-sky-200 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-xs">
                    <button onclick="setMode3D('explore')" id="modeBtnExplore" class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-extrabold bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 to-indigo-500 text-white shadow-md btn-bounce">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass-chart mr-2"></i> โหมดสำรวจโครงสร้าง 3D
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="setMode3D('game')" id="modeBtnGame" class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-extrabold text-slate-600 hover:text-amber-600 btn-bounce">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad mr-2 text-amber-500"></i> โหมดเกมทายโมเดล 3D ✨
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- EXPLORE MODE LAYOUT -->
            <div id="explore3DLayout" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
                <!-- Functional Groups List Buttons -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 cute-card rounded-3xl p-5 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 font-kanit border-b-2 border-sky-100 pb-3 mb-4 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="flex items-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-bars-staggered text-sky-500 mr-2"></i> เลือกหมู่ฟังก์ชันที่สนใจ</span>
                        <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-700 font-bold">7 ชนิด</span>
                    </h2>

                    <div class="space-y-2.5 max-h-[490px] overflow-y-auto pr-1" id="groupButtonsList">
                        <!-- Dynamic Buttons rendered via JS -->
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 3D Canvas & Info -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
                    <div class="cute-card rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2 border-b-2 border-sky-100 pb-3">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200 inline-block">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shapes mr-1"></i> โมเดล 3D หมุนได้ 360°
                                </span>
                                <h3 id="fgTitle" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black text-slate-800 font-kanit mt-1">ไฮดรอกซิล (hydroxyl)</h3>
                            </div>
                            <span id="fgFormula" class="text-base font-black font-mono text-indigo-700 bg-indigo-50 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-indigo-200 shadow-xs">R-OH</span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Three.js 3D Viewport Container -->
                        <div class="relative bg-slate-950 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden my-3 border-4 border-sky-200 shadow-inner min-h-[310px]">
                            <div id="canvas3DContainer" class="w-full h-72 cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing"></div>
                            
                            <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 text-[11px] font-bold bg-slate-900/80 text-sky-300 px-3 py-1.2 rounded-xl border border-sky-800 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer mr-1.5 text-amber-400"></i> ลากเพื่อหมุน | สกรอลล์ Zoom
                            </div>

                            <!-- Legend for Atoms -->
                            <div class="absolute bottom-2 left-2 right-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] text-white bg-slate-900/85 px-3 py-2 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 justify-center backdrop-blur-md">
                                <span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#2ea043] inline-block shadow-xs"></span> O (เขียว)</span>
                                <span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#a371f7] inline-block shadow-xs"></span> H (ม่วง)</span>
                                <span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#388bfd] inline-block shadow-xs"></span> C (ฟ้า)</span>
                                <span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#3fb950] inline-block shadow-xs"></span> N (เขียวอ่อน)</span>
                                <span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#f47067] inline-block shadow-xs"></span> S (ชมพู)</span>
                                <span class="flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#58a6ff] inline-block shadow-xs"></span> P (ฟ้าอ่อน)</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Details Info Grid -->
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2">
                            <div class="bg-amber-50 border-2 border-amber-200 p-4 rounded-2xl">
                                <div class="text-xs font-extrabold text-amber-900 flex items-center mb-1">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-apple-whole mr-1.5 text-amber-600 text-sm"></i> แหล่งที่พบในสารอินทรีย์:
                                </div>
                                <div id="fgLocation" class="text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold text-amber-950">น้ำตาล, กลีเซอรอล</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-indigo-50 border-2 border-indigo-200 p-4 rounded-2xl">
                                <div class="text-xs font-extrabold text-indigo-900 flex items-center mb-1">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles mr-1.5 text-indigo-600 text-sm"></i> สมบัติทางเคมีเบื้องต้น:
                                </div>
                                <div id="fgProperties" class="text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-950">มีขั้ว (Polar), ละลายน้ำได้ดี เกิดพันธะไฮโดรเจน</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- GAME 3D MODE LAYOUT -->
            <div id="game3DLayout" class="hidden max-w-4xl mx-auto cute-card rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-md border-4 border-amber-200 space-y-6">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b-2 border-amber-100 pb-4">
                    <div>
                        <span class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xs font-extrabold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Mini 3D Game 🎮</span>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 font-kanit mt-1">
                            เกมทายชื่อหมู่ฟังก์ชันจากโมเดล 3D
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-semibold">สังเกตอะตอมและสีในโมเดล 3D แล้วเลือกชื่อหมู่ฟังก์ชันที่ถูกต้อง</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-right bg-amber-50 px-4 py-2 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 shadow-xs">
                        <span class="text-xs text-amber-700 font-bold block">คะแนนสะสม</span>
                        <span id="game3DScore" class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-600">0</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 3D Game Canvas viewport -->
                <div class="relative bg-slate-950 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border-4 border-amber-300 shadow-inner h-80">
                    <div id="gameCanvas3DContainer" class="w-full h-full cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing"></div>
                    <div class="absolute top-3 left-3 text-[11px] font-bold bg-slate-900/80 text-amber-300 px-3 py-1 rounded-xl border border-amber-700">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate mr-1"></i> ลากหมุนเพื่อสังเกตโครงสร้าง 3D
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Answer Buttons -->
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 block mb-3">เลือกคำตอบที่ถูกต้อง:</span>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3" id="game3DOptions">
                        <!-- Options generated dynamically -->
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 2: NUTRIENT TESTING SIMULATION (LAB) -->
        <section id="nutrientLabTab" class="tab-content hidden space-y-6">
            <div class="cute-card border-l-8 border-amber-400 p-4 rounded-3xl shadow-sm flex items-start space-x-3 text-slate-700">
                <div class="bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 p-2.5 rounded-2xl text-xl flex-shrink-0">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-flask-vial"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-xs md:text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    <span class="font-bold text-amber-900 text-sm block">🧪 การทดลองทดสอบสารอาหารเสมือน:</span> 
                    เลือกหยดสารทดสอบเคมีลงในหลอดทดลองทั้ง 4 หลอด สังเกตการเปลี่ยนสี ตะกอน หรือการแยกชั้น เมื่อทดลองครบทุกหลอดจะมี **สติกเกอร์รางวัลสุดน่ารักเด้งฉลอง! 🎉**
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Test Tubes Display Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                
                <!-- Tube 1: Starch -->
                <div class="cute-card rounded-3xl p-5 border-2 border-amber-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-center justify-between min-h-[380px]">
                    <div class="text-center w-full border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
                        <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 rounded-full">หลอดที่ 1</span>
                        <h4 class="font-extrabold text-slate-800 font-kanit text-lg mt-1">แป้ง (Starch) 🍚</h4>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Tube Glass Canvas Animation -->
                    <div class="relative w-24 h-48 my-4 flex items-center justify-center">
                        <div class="tube-glass w-16 h-44 rounded-b-full relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end p-1">
                            <!-- Liquid inside tube -->
                            <div id="liquid-tube1" class="w-full h-24 bg-amber-50/70 rounded-b-full transition-all duration-1000 relative">
                                <div id="sediment-tube1" class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-0 transition-all duration-1000"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="w-full space-y-2">
                        <div id="status-tube1" class="text-[11px] text-center font-bold text-slate-500 min-h-[36px] flex items-center justify-center bg-sky-50 rounded-xl p-1.5 border border-sky-100">
                            ยังไม่ได้หยดสารทดสอบ
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5">
                            <button onclick="testNutrient(1, 'iodine')" class="py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold btn-bounce shadow-xs">ไอโอดีน</button>
                            <button onclick="testNutrient(1, 'benedict')" class="py-2 bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-600 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold btn-bounce shadow-xs">เบเนดิกต์</button>
                            <button onclick="testNutrient(1, 'biuret')" class="py-2 bg-purple-500 hover:bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold btn-bounce shadow-xs">ไบยูเรต</button>
                            <button onclick="testNutrient(1, 'sudan')" class="py-2 bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold btn-bounce shadow-xs">ซูดาน III</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tube 2: Reducing Sugar -->
                <div class="cute-card rounded-3xl p-5 border-2 border-cyan-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-center justify-between min-h-[380px]">
                    <div class="text-center w-full border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
                        <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold px-3 py-1 bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 rounded-full">หลอดที่ 2</span>
                        <h4 class="font-extrabold text-slate-800 font-kanit text-lg mt-1">น้ำตาลรีดิวซิ่ง 🍬</h4>
                    </div>

                    <div class="relative w-24 h-48 my-4 flex items-center justify-center">
                        <div class="tube-glass w-16 h-44 rounded-b-full relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end p-1">
                            <div id="liquid-tube2" class="w-full h-24 bg-slate-100/80 rounded-b-full transition-all duration-1000 relative">
                                <div id="sediment-tube2" class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-0 transition-all duration-1000"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="w-full space-y-2">
                        <div id="status-tube2" class="text-[11px] text-center font-bold text-slate-500 min-h-[36px] flex items-center justify-center bg-sky-50 rounded-xl p-1.5 border border-sky-100">
                            ยังไม่ได้หยดสารทดสอบ
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-1.5">
                            <button onclick="testNutrient(2, 'iodine')" class="py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold btn-bounce shadow-xs">ไอโอดีน</button>
                            <button onclick="testNutrient(2, 'benedict')" class="py-2 bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-600 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold btn-bounce shadow-xs">เบเนดิกต์</button>
                            <button onclick="testNutrient(2, 'biuret')" class="py-2 bg-purple-500 hover:bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold btn-bounce shadow-xs">ไบยูเรต</button>
                            <button onclick="testNutrient(2, 'sudan')" class="py-2 bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 text-white rounded-xl text-xs font-extrabold btn-bounce shadow-xs">ซูดาน III</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tube 3: Protein -->
                <div class="cute-card rounded-3xl p-5 border-2 border-purple-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-center justify-between min-h-[380px]">
                    <div class="text-center w-full border-b border-slate-200 pb-2">
                        <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold px-3 py-1 bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 rounded-full">หลอดที่ 3</span>
                        <h4 class="font-extrabold text-slate-800 font-kanit text-lg mt-1">โปรตีน (Protein) 🥚</h4>
                    </div>

